     **Summary of the[0m[2m decision[0m[2m:[0m[2m Redis Streams over Apache[0m[2m Kafka.**
     
     The[0m[2m recommendation[0m[2m rests on the[0m[2m gap[0m[2m between what[0m[2m Kafka provides[0m[2m and what this[0m[2m system[0m[2m actually needs:
     
