     - **Oper[0m[2mational fit[0m[2m**: A[0m[2m 6-person team[0m[2m with no Kafka[0m[2m experience and no dedicated[0m[2m infra engineer cannot[0m[2m absorb[0m[2m Kafka's operational[0m[2m surface[0m[2m area[0m[2m within[0m[2m a[0m[2m 2-week deadline[0m[2m. Redis Streams runs[0m[2m on the instance[0m[2m the[0m[2m team already operates.[0m[2m
